### advertising 목록 조회 — search·offset·limit 모두 선택 (기본 offset=0, limit=20)
GET {{host}}/advertising?search=&offset=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### advertising 단건 조회
GET {{host}}/advertising/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### advertising 생성 — image는 URL 직접 입력 (선택)
POST {{host}}/advertising
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "테스트 광고",
	"advertiser_id": 1,
	"tracker_id": 1,
	"image": "https://example.com/image.png"
}

### advertising 수정 — 전체 교체 방식 (create와 동일 필드 모두 필요)
PUT {{host}}/advertising/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "수정된 광고",
	"advertiser_id": 1,
	"tracker_id": 1,
	"image": "https://example.com/image2.png"
}

### advertising 이미지 업로드 — multipart, 필드명 image (5MB 이하 이미지, S3 저장 후 URL 갱신)
POST {{host}}/advertising/1/image
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="sample.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./sample.png
--Boundary--

### advertising 삭제
DELETE {{host}}/advertising/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
